{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "d17e1cb69d505a9e6a0c32bc21307030890052c8f031e1e37cd742f1759b4ab4", "ja": "眼差し", "zh": "眼神", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2b76a32cb546115b32ae02a7d16c962526ef88cb8883dc4444c24cba13659aa5", "ja": "ヘトヘトになるまでダンスレッスンを重ねる\n雪歩。真が止めても、レッスンをやめようと\nしない。雪歩は「39プロジェクトのみんなに\n追いつき、追い抜きたい、それが劇場のみん\nなにとってもいい刺激になるはず」と語る。", "zh": "雪步已筋疲力竭仍持续进行舞蹈训练，\n即使真出言阻止也不愿停下。雪步表示\n她想追上甚至超越39PROJECT的成员，\n也相信这对剧场的大家来说必会成为\n良性刺激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1794f1674ed5f10e677c1fabd186b77066cc4c53ec33996c1f5047b9ef72b61f", "ja": "（今日は雪歩と真が、バラエティ番組で次回公演の\n告知をする予定だ。小粋な宣伝を期待してるぞ！）", "zh": "（今天雪步和真预计要在综艺节目上宣传下次公演，\n很期待她们妙语如珠的宣传！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1001_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "1dc21fd247111b359dedd10150b4a60fbfcc1a701b3ff308f4b11a3d4479023f", "ja": "……ほほう、ついに『765PRO ALLSTARS』の\nオンリー公演を、765プロ劇場で行うんですね？", "zh": "……喔喔，765艺能剧场终于要举办\n『765PRO ALLSTARS』的专属公演了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "e3e55c9d9ecb7dcea0d356bbb9cd276a13630c43f4c8d3ba83be09e5439e29cd", "ja": "そうなんです！　今まで劇場では、39プロジェクトの\nみんなが中心になって頑張って来ましたけどね。", "zh": "没错！过去剧场都是以39PROJECT的成员为主轴，\n一路努力走到这一天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "64e4fd920ad1b9cf4153f95a9679efde95ea2bbba173ef7dceaa474da5985ee5", "ja": "今回は、私たち13人の公演ですから……\nし、劇場のみんなに負けないように、頑張りましゅ！", "zh": "而这次是我们13个人的公演……\n我、我们会努力，不会输给剧场的大家滴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "62589f6dc54c7f25d0e74d0bc7d5c728c61ac047c82a205dd4e2ae1cb6a24ad3", "ja": "（わはははは！）", "zh": "（哇哈哈哈哈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f0e49e9bbf46f509cdf9ff9d83ae782df0a51a0f85111c7cfa695192842fa1ff", "ja": "はうう……。\nまずは、噛まないように頑張りますね……。", "zh": "啊呜呜……\n看来我得先努力不要吃螺丝呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "62589f6dc54c7f25d0e74d0bc7d5c728c61ac047c82a205dd4e2ae1cb6a24ad3", "ja": "（わはははは！）", "zh": "（哇哈哈哈哈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "db875c20b9b0a4ef29689cb69ee3ebcb3e8e5700b194704d11cb6b42c87b0ff4", "ja": "（……小粋ではなかったけどオチのついた、\nいい告知だった。二人とも、今日はお疲れさま！）", "zh": "（……虽然称不上妙语如珠，但笑果十足，\n是一次很不错的宣传。两位今天辛苦了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5d53c1d96aa6279f4dd50031d9b1fa682cfbb1db4c3a1b4bcd214d17ef2ce0d8", "ja": "（……と、言おうと思ったのだが……）", "zh": "（……原本想对她们这样说的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "aa35d73869006c3af8d99ba15c90f7bce6664b8ac73df9a6ad97871a681ad7d6", "ja": "（劇場に戻ってすぐ、二人はレッスンを始めた。\nだいぶ時間がたったけど、まだ明かりが点いたままだ）", "zh": "（但一回到剧场，两人就立刻投入训练。\n都经过很长一段时间了，练习室的灯仍然亮着。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3898bc54472818573f6b439435db0fffba86ec91ebc16711c9bc70a56eb71f2e", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。\n真ちゃん、今のはどう……かな？", "zh": "呼、呼……\n小真，我刚刚跳得怎么样……呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "49bd633f28ce425afc37b17813740fdf2c7a93ae893ddcfc8b012531f4706f0a", "ja": "うん、いいと思うよ！\n最後までバッチリ踊りきれてた。", "zh": "嗯，在下觉得很棒！\n从头到尾都跳得非常完美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "07babb99a0b96c901f94c6f72d310cad1233703c2306577d316841009c84d0d2", "ja": "ほ、ほんと……？　でも、真ちゃんの方が\nキレもあって動きも大きいし……。", "zh": "真、真的吗……？\n但是小真跳得比较有力道，动作也很大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1ca0e9f670e73aa732f333a838a352e94799f6d70bcccab69d2f20750b713f24", "ja": "やっぱり、あと一回だけ……。\n最後まで通しでやってみていい？", "zh": "还是再练一次吧……\n可以试着跳完整首吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "c642c951d3886a2843a19f7e6c4f3ede1542c87d1a7d922320999a03c5ccf304", "ja": "えっ、ボクはいいけど……。大丈夫、雪歩？　\nさっきからフラフラじゃないか。", "zh": "咦？在下是没问题啦……但雪步你还好吗？\n你从刚刚就开始站不太稳了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "0dd84e29efcaf591fcdc729cb2bf0212dd834879ea042493aa4ee495b38c6f0b", "ja": "レッスンなら明日だって出来るし、\n今日はこれくらいにしても……。", "zh": "要训练的话可以明天再练，\n今天就先到这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "f09647a87a8fa7f4043bfcf672e6b2d161e8a5ecba65a198ef6dd70251e0ba2c", "ja": "雪歩……？", "zh": "雪步……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "705f302bfaa0a09ba72a9d5284ed3e2362bf54a49d1c73194fa82413d7f0bf8f", "ja": "ごめんね、真ちゃん。心配してくれてるのに……。\nでも……、もう少しだけお願い。", "zh": "对不起，小真，你明明这么担心我……\n但是……拜托再陪我练一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "36c102d3318bc7406d63b29f23ed9397281b4935c650d13ba2d0b297e192a3c3", "ja": "このままだと私、追い抜かれたまま\n置いていかれちゃうから……。", "zh": "再这样下去，我会一直跟不上，\n被大家抛在后头的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "89c0c827e19c38bcc279c1873e3f4c54d1d1cb0f787e239d98a0feab577cf41f", "ja": "置いていかれるって……。\n雪歩、どういう意味？", "zh": "被抛在后头……\n雪步，这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "af4261ee5a1bbe738f8a13750ee83a02ca4cdc48d0353a91445abeea0867bdd4", "ja": "……私のダンス、39プロジェクトのみんなにも\nどんどん追い抜かされちゃってるよね。", "zh": "……在舞蹈方面，\n连39PROJECT的成员也一个个超越我了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7946c5f33054ed15b33a12c9459e4e7978f6622798f45994dd8061535fc9496d", "ja": "歩ちゃんにエレナちゃん……。それから、私よりずっと\n年下の環ちゃんにまで、追い抜かされちゃった。", "zh": "不仅是小步、艾琳娜……\n就连小我好几岁的小环都超越我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "95e08222bb2b54b26e1a432b06127d56f1d293de14f687689e6b62fb7549cd64", "ja": "みんなが上手になるのは、すっごく嬉しいの！\n本当だよ？　……でも……。", "zh": "看大家越来越进步，我也很开心！\n这是真的！但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1cf6cc35630cf9aab2fcd8053921bf28d2afcbe490fd051298aeeb5c91c9ae6b", "ja": "おんなじくらい……\n悔しいなぁって……。", "zh": "越是觉得开心……\n同时也越不甘心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed", "ja": "……うん。", "zh": "……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1026_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ca5a797f2919c1601781baf5082dec89a488f8e30c77bbd14f09d73078d12691", "ja": "……だからね、今度は私が、\nみんなのことを追い抜きたいって……思うんだ。", "zh": "……所以呀，\n我这次想要……超越大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9a79b90b3298191d1d8d071704693be797729e76840ebd2a7aac2d019a775834", "ja": "こんな私に追い抜かれたら、きっとみんな、\n悔しくて、もっと頑張ろうって思ってくれるよね。", "zh": "要是被我超越，大家一定会觉得不甘心，\n产生更加努力的动力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fc05c1eddaff156c8f3bc9a0e4e23142ea9e7c7258e8f3c0f80c167078d70c0f", "ja": "それでみんながまた、私のことを追い抜いたら、\nもう一回、私が頑張って、みんなを追い抜いて……。", "zh": "然后大家会再超越我，\n我就要再努力一次，超越大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "35ad5bedb30ff04743e29da7d377ebe8a530c56ebb0b5357877b3cb84e04277c", "ja": "そしたらいつか、みんなで一緒に、とっても……\n上手になれるんじゃないかな、なんて……。", "zh": "这样一来，将来大家就能一起……\n变得非常厉害，我是这样想的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "12a54b250f58eeb1308d86f483153a3e26eccc74170cb850c72cf66bb6366805", "ja": "うん！　ボクもそう思うよ！", "zh": "嗯！在下也这么认为喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e8fd3fb8375ca2fa076a887c64272532b55cf44f51d75a220e4ec102bf157848", "ja": "……ほ、ホント？　私なんかが、\nこんなこと言って……笑っちゃわない？", "zh": "……真、真的吗？\n像我这种人还说这种话……不会很可笑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "baf35a7c8c551a3b813c5570b4a3e9bdd825f06e19e202a05f4defcaac8d9f84", "ja": "ちっとも可笑しくない。\n今の雪歩……すっごくカッコいいよ。", "zh": "一点都不可笑。\n现在的雪步……非常帅气喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1033_004yuk", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1034_006mak", "source_sha256": "d2a4ec16b7f1f540f8dc5c41a08457c30b23892f2adcfe0c7381a60ced6f8c5d", "ja": "そういうところ、本当にカッコいいと思う。\nへへっ、ボクも見習わなくちゃね！", "zh": "在下觉得你这一点真的很帅气。\n嘿嘿，在下也要向你看齐才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1035_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4dcdbe0d1b7a8edb75684ee59d6a57a3a65f9cc8c2024e104485db964e4a7dc6", "ja": "わ、私、カッコいいなんて……。\n言ってもらえたの、初めてかも……。", "zh": "我、我很帅气……\n好像是第一次有人这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1036_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5399c8ba7bf43de841336597795064e6c4087e491b2f67803c5ed9c03b3b9596", "ja": "こんなに……う、嬉しいんだね……。\nえへへ♪", "zh": "没想到竟然……会、会让人这么开心……\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "59117e0683726197a3ba28e7d428ad0b5111e948f1fec90baa6aa0ef2097bfaf", "ja": "そうなんだ？　ボクは雪歩のこと、ずっとそう思って\nたのに……。もっと早く言えばよかったかな。", "zh": "是吗？在下一直都觉得雪步很帅啊……\n看来该早点说出口的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
