{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1039_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7e0bf9d2de75ffa7074c578421a5333f0e8b282954f574fd09ec1e17ab336566", "ja": "……、うん！", "zh": "……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0087_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "1fe310d4292998451a191ac3f888142ef59e7e81246d96799604e813b90579f7", "ja": "（口を挟もうと思ったけど……。\n必要なかったみたいだな）", "zh": "（原本打算打岔讲几句的……\n看来是没有必要呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
